{"version":1,"id":"alyssa-grace-bloodstream","title":"bloodstream","artist":"Alyssa Grace","key":"C","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/alyssa-grace/bloodstream/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Steven Martinez and Alyssa Grace","chords":[{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"G#m","canonical":"G#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[8,11,3],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"B","canonical":"B","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,3,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#","canonical":"F#","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,10,1],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"Maybe I was too young to fully understand","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"So I never healed from it healthy, why I never trusted the man","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"You gotta love all that you have, and I'll take that to my grave","columns":64,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Soon you'll open up your eyes, and it'll all be gone one day","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":41,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm sitting here convincing you to pick up the phone and call","columns":65,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"I am my father's daughter, but I'm nothing like him at all","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":35,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"And I hear him in the way I speak, or when I look in the mirror","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":43,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"The anger's growing in me, it shows, could it be any clearer?","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"That I'm like him 'cause he made me the way I am","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":40,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"When we're fighting, and all I need is somebody","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":25,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":41,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm crying on my mama's floor","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"Why don't you want this anymore?","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm craving you to change for me","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"You're saying: I hear you, and I love","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"You, but my heart, it hurts for you","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"And I just cannot give you what you need","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Am I too much? Am I enough? 'Cause you said you wouldn't give up","columns":64,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"Now I'm numb on my knees, praying to God you'd talk to me","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Wondering what it takes for you to stay","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"Off my mind and far out of my bloodstream","columns":45,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":31,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F#","column":43,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"You never laid your hands on me, and","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"That's something that I'm grateful for","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"But I should've known that you'd gone","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"Mad when I saw the way you punched your doors","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"And I don't regret loving you, 'cause I know that you needed it","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"But the way you treated me made me feel like a little kid","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"And something deep inside of me","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"Tells me that you're not better now","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm sorry that I couldn't help, but I'm so glad I made it out","columns":65,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":40,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm crying on my mama's floor","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"Why don't you want this anymore?","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm craving you to change for me","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"You're saying: I hear you, and I love","columns":37,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"You, but my heart, it hurts for you","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"And I just cannot give you what you need","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"Am I too much? Am I enough? 'Cause you said you wouldn't give up","columns":64,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"Now I'm numb on my knees, praying to God you'd talk to me","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"Wondering what it takes for you to stay","columns":39,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"lyric","text":"Off my mind and far out of my bloodstream","columns":51,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":31,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F#","column":43,"beat":4},{"symbol":"E","column":50,"beat":6}]}]}